  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#the-document-object:dom-document-body\r\n\r\nCurrently it's defined as:\r\n\r\n```\r\n [CEReactions] attribute HTMLElement? body;\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut could it be instead defined as:\r\n\r\n```\r\n [CEReactions] attribute (HTMLBodyElement or HTMLFrameSetElement)? body;\r\n```\r\n\r\nfor better tooling support e.g. TSJS-lib-generator?",
